  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="900" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Field operations in low-connectivity conditions</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1080" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform is designed for boundary checks, corridor reviews, environmental inspections, and evidence capture in places where connectivity is inconsistent.</text>
  <shape id="screenshot-frame" type="rect" x="58" y="132" width="660" height="480" fill="paper" stroke="border" stroke-width="1" shadow="true"/>
  <image id="field-shot" src="https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/i7Z8860JB409ZwkKDDtAu7/sandbox/slides_resource_ilxvirqgh4ifccy9plf8t-99b462a3-e2b-prod-us2_1784580204556_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2lkbHJfcHRzX21vYmlsZS9wcmVzZW50YXRpb25fYXNzZXRzL2ZpZWxkX3NlZWRlZF92MQ.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1786752000&__&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEQCIFM20UbS~zLPhrzjJP2~SkoAqPfTkysy6V0eTZJzfZ2PAiB3v0LS6sQyqDip1babyDAXyAW30RyejkLxHgGFQRlAlw__" x="70" y="144" width="636" height="450" fit="cover"/>
  <text id="shot-caption" x="86" y="596" width="604" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" align="center">Real web screenshot: field mission workspace with mission priority, evidence counts, sync risk, and workflow stage</text>
  <shape id="intro-card" type="rect" x="756" y="142" width="466" height="112" fill="surface" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="intro-copy" x="780" y="166" width="418" height="68" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.35">Field teams do not have to wait for perfect connectivity before they can work. Mission records, parcel-linked evidence, and workflow context stay usable even when the network is weak or unstable.</text>
  <shape id="cap-1" type="rect" x="756" y="278" width="466" height="94" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="cap-1-title" x="780" y="298" width="418" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Offline continuity</strong></p></text>
  <text id="cap-1-copy" x="780" y="324" width="418" height="28" font="body" size="15" color="muted">Field missions persist locally, so work can continue outside stable broadband zones.</text>
  <shape id="cap-2" type="rect" x="756" y="390" width="466" height="94" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="cap-2-title" x="780" y="410" width="418" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Secure local access</strong></p></text>
  <text id="cap-2-copy" x="780" y="436" width="418" height="28" font="body" size="15" color="muted">Cached audit packages and sensitive records remain encrypted and can require biometric unlock.</text>
  <shape id="cap-3" type="rect" x="756" y="502" width="466" height="110" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="cap-3-title" x="780" y="522" width="418" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Replay and reconciliation</strong></p></text>
  <text id="cap-3-copy" x="780" y="548" width="418" height="42" font="body" size="15" color="muted" line-height="1.3">When service returns, queued field events, geofence signals, and audit actions can be replayed and reconciled instead of being lost or duplicated.</text>
  <text id="footer" x="58" y="686" width="540" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" wrap="false">IDLR-PTS Platform • Nigeria stakeholder deck</text>
